###

# @name google_books
GET https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes?key=AIzaSyAw8qmNMo-PVZDBljHl5hwzAV3oH1KBEIw&q=intitle:Abaddons+inauthor:James

###

# @name openlibrary_author
GET https://openlibrary.org/search/authors.json?q=james%20corey

###

# @name openlibrary_search
GET https://openlibrary.org/search.json?q=abadonns